---
// 還沒有上架商品時顯示：引導到海外代購或 LINE 詢問
import { shop } from "../config/shop";
import { url } from "../lib/url";
---

<div class="rounded-2xl border border-dashed border-line bg-surface px-6 py-12 text-center">
  <div class="text-lg font-bold">商品陸續上架中</div>
  <p class="mx-auto mt-2 max-w-md text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted">
    現貨商品整理中，很快就會上架。想找特定的卡，可以先用海外代購詢價，或直接 LINE 問我們。
  </p>
  <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-2">
    <a href={url("/proxy/")} class="rounded-xl bg-accent px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-bold text-accent-ink">
      海外代購詢價
    </a>
    <a
      href={shop.lineUrl}
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener"
      class="rounded-xl border border-ink px-5 py-2.5 text-sm font-medium"
    >
      LINE 詢問
    </a>
  </div>
</div>
